From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Date: Wed, 1 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] spi: designware: add k230 enhanced spi and internal dma

The K230 SPI controllers are DWC SSI cores with the enhanced SPI frame
formats and an internal AXI DMA. Add enhanced dual, quad and octal
transfers, the internal DMA path, the DTR frequency and RX sample delay
properties, and the K230 SSI control register setup.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 drivers/spi/designware_spi.c | 908 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++---------
 1 file changed, 673 insertions(+), 235 deletions(-)

